        "inspected": true,
        "observations": "Entire500x752 ordinary east picture inspected. Three projecting round/faceted stone apses, taller broad central apse, brick repair/cornice bands, narrow framed rectangular and round-headed windows with recessed dark glazing/grilles, original simplified lozenge/trim relief. Above: faceted drum with blind arched surrounds, narrow windows, metal conical cap and cross."
